global stanna, b

on exitFrame
  [  0] pusharglistnoret 0 ...................... <>
  [  2] extcall 23 .............................. unloadMember()
  [  4] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [  5] setglobal 16 ............................ stanna = 0
  [  7] pushint8 14 ............................. <14>
  [ 10] pusharglist 1 ........................... <14>
  [ 12] extcall 4 ............................... <sprite(14)>
  [ 14] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [ 17] setobjprop 5 ............................ sprite(14).visible = 1
  [ 19] pushint8 8 .............................. <8>
  [ 22] pusharglist 1 ........................... <8>
  [ 24] extcall 4 ............................... <sprite(8)>
  [ 26] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [ 27] setobjprop 5 ............................ sprite(8).visible = 0
  [ 29] pushint8 2 .............................. <2>
  [ 32] pushint8 255 ............................ <255>
  [ 35] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [ 38] set 4 ................................... set the volume of sound 2 to 255
  [ 40] pusharglist 0 ........................... <>
  [ 42] thebuiltin 12 ........................... <the frame>
  [ 44] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [ 47] add ..................................... <the frame + 1>
  [ 48] pushint8 5 .............................. <5>
  [ 51] div ..................................... <(the frame + 1) / 5>
  [ 52] pusharglist 1 ........................... <(the frame + 1) / 5>
  [ 54] extcall 25 .............................. <integer((the frame + 1) / 5)>
  [ 56] setglobal 19 ............................ b = integer((the frame + 1) / 5)
  [ 58] ret
end
